BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Canvass for Jackie Elward and Joanna Paun!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T123000
UID:4ebbd77b66684ec033ed188cbb8a0a34@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/CA%20GOTV%20Events%20%281200%20x%20630%20px%29%20%2811%29_202
 60420211128985772.png
DESCRIPTION:The North Bay deserves working class champions to represent us
  in the California Assembly and the Sonoma County Board of Supervisors! Jo
 in Sonoma County Conservation Action\, California Teacher's Association\, 
 Project Super Bloom and the Working Families Party to canvass for Jackie E
 lward for Assembly and Joanna Paun for Supervisor!
LOCATION:1645 Peggy Ln\, Petaluma\, CA\, 94954
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/ca-wfp/event/936990/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trump Regime Takedown
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260509T140000
UID:2a54f28ee56757e89fc10092caaba4e6@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/TrumpRegimeTakedown_Mobilize_20250829181612632740.png
DESCRIPTION:We do not consent to Trump and his billionaire allies taking a
  chainsaw to our government and our economy for their benefit! San Francis
 co is a sanctuary city and We the People need to defend the values that ma
 ke it so. Let’s stand united and oppose the endless assaults on our comm
 unities\, our civil rights\, the rule of law\, and our democracy. Keep dem
 ocracy alive every Saturday by showing up\, taking a stand\, and sticking 
 together for the long haul. Standing together is better than standing alon
 e
LOCATION:Corner of Van Ness and O'Farrell\, 999 Van Ness Ave\, San Francis
 co\, CA\, 94109
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/indivisible/event/835089/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
