 ploads/event/Sonoma%20Announcement%20Horizontal%201200%20w_202602131851092
 42770.jpg
DESCRIPTION:# Welcome to our States Win Sonoma 2026 Membership Meeting Ser
 ies. We are the Sonoma chapter of States Win\, a grass-roots organization 
 focused on changing red or purple state legislatures to blue to build demo
 cratic power for the future. The members meet monthly near Sebastopol on t
 he third Wednesday of the month. Our membership meeting includes updates a
 nd decisions on events\, phonebanking\, postcarding\, and other activities
 . We often have special guests at our meetings\, including the candidates
LOCATION:Graton\, CA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/stateswinsonomacounty/event/903474/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
