 ing Families Party to canvass for Jackie Elward! People of all ages are we
 lcome! Jackie is the worker's choice\, and the people's choice. Assembly D
 istrict 12 deserves a leader like Jackie! We will be doing a canvass train
 ing for new and experienced canvassers before heading out. What to bring: 
 - comfortable walking shoes - light weight water bottle - hat or sun-glass
 es
LOCATION:Bolinas\, CA
