 ploads/event/Capitol%20cropped_20260501212632587069.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for our final general meeting before the **June
  Primary**. That means we'll be discussing our endorsements\, key races an
 d candidates – and the nail-biting governor's race. We'll be talking abo
 ut volunteering you can do for campaigns\, as well as other actions. And t
 here will likely be a few words about the Supreme Court and what needs to 
 be done. Democracy is not a spectator sport. Come join us!
